  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IAs">I As</ref> 1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Ic wille, þæt [mine] biscopas ⁊ þa gerefan hit beodan eallum þam þe him hyran scylan, ⁊ þæt hit to þam rihtan andagan gelæst sy [⁊ ðæs sie to ðæm dæg ðær beheafdunges seint Iơhannes þæs fulhteres].</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And I desire my bishops and the reeves to give this order to all those whose duty it is to obey them, and that it [the payment] be rendered on the legally-appointed day; and that shall be the day on which Saint John the Baptist was beheaded.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ ic wille, þæt biscopas ⁊ þa gerefan hit beodan eallum þam þe him hiran sculon, þæt hit to ðam rihtan andagan gelæst sy.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
